<title>CHINA: Bossini Int'l year net rises 87.84 pct.</title>
<headline>Bossini Int'l year net rises 87.84 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   23.46    vs 12.49</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    64.36    vs 34.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,381.02 vs 1,126.74</p>
<p>    Company name		 Bossini International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Bossini International designs and retails casual apparel and accessories.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is six H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of one cent) vs three cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
